{"id":50845,"date":"2026-04-27T07:12:06","date_gmt":"2026-04-27T06:12:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-roma\/"},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:14:57","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:14:57","slug":"maratona-de-roma","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-roma\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Roma 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Roma 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Roma 2027<\/strong> (32\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o oficial da <strong>Run Rome The Marathon<\/strong>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, em <strong>Roma, It\u00e1lia<\/strong>, integrando a v\u00e9spera festiva de s\u00e1bado, <strong>13 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>. Distinguida com o selo FIDAL Gold Label e parceira do circuito European Marathon Classics e do programa AbbottWMM Wanda Age Group World Rankings, a prova proporciona uma travessia monumental \u00fanica pelo cora\u00e7\u00e3o da Cidade Eterna.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo tem partida na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Via dei Fori Imperiali<\/strong> (junto ao Coliseu) e meta instalada no hist\u00f3rico <strong>Circo Massimo<\/strong>. No domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, disputa-se a <strong>Maratona de 42,195 km<\/strong> (partida por vagas entre as 08:00 e as 09:00, com hor\u00e1rio de refer\u00eancia \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong> e tempo limite generoso de 7h00, aberta tamb\u00e9m a praticantes de Fitwalking) e a <strong>Estafeta Run4Rome<\/strong> (\u00e0s <strong>09:15<\/strong>, para equipas de 4 elementos ligadas ao programa solid\u00e1rio). No s\u00e1bado, 13 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>, realiza-se a <strong>Fun Run \u2013 Stracittadina de 5 km<\/strong>, aberta a participantes de todas as idades.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo cons\u00f3rcio formado pela <strong>Infront Italy S.p.A., Corriere dello Sport S.r.l. e Rome Marathon Runners S.S.D. a r.l.<\/strong>, sob a \u00e9gide da FIDAL e da World Athletics, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o percorre mais de 20 monumentos mundiais \u2014 incluindo o Coliseu, Piazza Venezia, Bas\u00edlica de S\u00e3o Paulo, Pir\u00e2mide C\u00e9stia, Isola Tiberina, Castelo Sant&#8217;Angelo, Via della Conciliazione e Bas\u00edlica de S\u00e3o Pedro, Foro Italico, Ponte Milvio, Piazza del Popolo, Piazza di Spagna e Piazza Navona \u2014 assegurando abastecimentos a cada 5 km, servi\u00e7o de pacers oficiais (das 3h00 \u00e0s 6h30) e medalha oficial de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Roma, It\u00e1lia<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42,195 km, Estafeta 42,195 km (4x) e 5 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Infront Italy S.p.A., Corriere dello Sport S.r.l. e Rome Marathon Runners S.S.D. a r.l.<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7h00 (Maratona 42,195 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.runromethemarathon.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/RRTM27-regolamento-inglese-23-4-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Maratona de Roma 42,195 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 99,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estafetas<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Estafeta Run4Rome (Equipas de 4 Atletas)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Fun Run \u2013 Stracittadina 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de Roma 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 32\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Maratona de Roma (Run Rome The Marathon) realiza-se no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, em Roma, It\u00e1lia, com partida na Via dei Fori Imperiali (junto ao Coliseu) e meta no Circo Massimo. Na v\u00e9spera, s\u00e1bado, 13 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, \u00e0s 09:00, decorre a Fun Run (Stracittadina) de 5 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e o tempo limite da Maratona?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, a partida da Maratona (42,195 km) \u00e9 efetuada por vagas entre as 08:00 (atletas em cadeira de rodas) e as 09:00 (vagas A a E, com hor\u00e1rio geral de refer\u00eancia \u00e0s 08:30), seguida da Estafeta Run4Rome \u00e0s 09:15. O tempo limite oficial da Maratona \u00e9 de 7h00, com tempos de corte interm\u00e9dios aos 10 km (1h40), 21,097 km (3h30) e 30 km (5h00).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e condi\u00e7\u00f5es para atletas internacionais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial fixa o pre\u00e7o de abertura da Maratona em 99,00 \u20ac na primeira fase (at\u00e9 30 de maio de 2026), evoluindo por escal\u00f5es temporais at\u00e9 ao fecho das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es. Atletas estrangeiros n\u00e3o residentes em It\u00e1lia podem participar na vertente competitiva (com certificado m\u00e9dico ou Runcard) ou no regime Non-Competitive \/ Tourism &#038; Sport (sem necessidade de atestado m\u00e9dico competitivo, assinando o termo de responsabilidade no levantamento do dorsal).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 feito o levantamento do dorsal e kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O dorsal e o pacote oficial do atleta s\u00e3o levantados presencialmente na Expo Village instalada no Circo Massimo, em Roma (a 50 metros da esta\u00e7\u00e3o de Metro B Circo Massimo), nos dias que antecedem a prova. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no domingo da corrida.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Maratona de Roma 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal oficial (personalizado com o nome para inscritos at\u00e9 17 de fevereiro de 2027), seguro, chip de cronometragem, camisola t\u00e9cnica oficial e saco do evento, transporte e dep\u00f3sito de bagagem, abastecimentos a cada 5 km, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica, servi\u00e7o de pacers oficiais e medalha oficial de finalista.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Roma 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Roma, It\u00e1lia\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Roma\", \"addressRegion\": \"It\u00e1lia\", \"addressCountry\": \"IT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Infront Italy S.p.A., Corriere dello Sport S.r.l. e Rome Marathon Runners S.S.D. a r.l.\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de Roma 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 32\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Maratona de Roma (Run Rome The Marathon) realiza-se no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, em Roma, It\u00e1lia, com partida na Via dei Fori Imperiali (junto ao Coliseu) e meta no Circo Massimo. Na v\u00e9spera, s\u00e1bado, 13 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, \u00e0s 09:00, decorre a Fun Run (Stracittadina) de 5 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e o tempo limite da Maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, a partida da Maratona (42,195 km) \u00e9 efetuada por vagas entre as 08:00 (atletas em cadeira de rodas) e as 09:00 (vagas A a E, com hor\u00e1rio geral de refer\u00eancia \u00e0s 08:30), seguida da Estafeta Run4Rome \u00e0s 09:15. O tempo limite oficial da Maratona \u00e9 de 7h00, com tempos de corte interm\u00e9dios aos 10 km (1h40), 21,097 km (3h30) e 30 km (5h00).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e condi\u00e7\u00f5es para atletas internacionais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento oficial fixa o pre\u00e7o de abertura da Maratona em 99,00 \u20ac na primeira fase (at\u00e9 30 de maio de 2026), evoluindo por escal\u00f5es temporais at\u00e9 ao fecho das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es. Atletas estrangeiros n\u00e3o residentes em It\u00e1lia podem participar na vertente competitiva (com certificado m\u00e9dico ou Runcard) ou no regime Non-Competitive \/ Tourism & Sport (sem necessidade de atestado m\u00e9dico competitivo, assinando o termo de responsabilidade no levantamento do dorsal).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde \u00e9 feito o levantamento do dorsal e kit de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O dorsal e o pacote oficial do atleta s\u00e3o levantados presencialmente na Expo Village instalada no Circo Massimo, em Roma (a 50 metros da esta\u00e7\u00e3o de Metro B Circo Massimo), nos dias que antecedem a prova. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no domingo da corrida.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Maratona de Roma 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal oficial (personalizado com o nome para inscritos at\u00e9 17 de fevereiro de 2027), seguro, chip de cronometragem, camisola t\u00e9cnica oficial e saco do evento, transporte e dep\u00f3sito de bagagem, abastecimentos a cada 5 km, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica, servi\u00e7o de pacers oficiais e medalha oficial de finalista.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66994,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,1491,31],"event_type_2":[627,1059],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50845","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-roma-italia","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-estafetas","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-europa","event_type_2-italia","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/maratona-de-roma-2026-1024x1024.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50845","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=50845"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50845\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70704,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50845\/revisions\/70704"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/66994"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=50845"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=50845"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/